    "description": "Yeah, i need to come with a better name. Link: https://dream-search-repeat.itch.io/tom-the-gatekeeper-knigh This is a prototype. Is still usable if you have an Local LLM server app and jq. The idea is to use a local AI to control a NPC in videogames. Making them capable to talk and 'think' than usual NPC's. This way a game can feel more 'alive'. This can be used in both 3D and 2D games. Either sci fi, medieval fantasy or something realistic like idk: GTA, Watchdogs, etc. If you have any question, please tell me in the commends. Música: Obra: Realidades Fragmentadas Música de https://www.fiftysounds.com/es/",
